"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2811,"**
Narrated to us ‘Ali ibn Sa‘id ibn Masruq al-Kindi: Narrated to us Hafs ibn Ghiyath, on the authority of Ja‘far ibn Muhammad, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Jabir (RA) who said:
“The Prophet (ﷺ) combined the two prayers, Zuhr and ‘Asr, at ‘Arafat with one adhan and two iqamahs. He also combined Maghrib and ‘Isha at al-Muzdalifah with one adhan and two iqamahs.”"
